WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.662
AND OR and NOT are the basic building blocks of SQL
decision

00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:09.300
rules AND requires all connected conditions to be
true OR requires

00:00:09.325 --> 00:00:14.975
at least one NOT reverses a known Boolean result SQL
also has

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.288
UNKNOWN usually because a comparison involves NULL
That extra state changes how

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:25.838
some compound expressions behave Think about the
practical effect AND usually narrows

00:00:25.862 --> 00:00:29.600
a cohort OR usually broadens it and NOT excludes a
condition only

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:33.700
when the truth state is known The next slides
separate the operators

00:00:33.725 --> 00:00:37.038
so you can see their behavior before combining them
with missing values

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.138
and precedence rules
